{"id":"W25e51c692a413020b55cca44","zh":"二维插值算子","en":"","name":"二维插值算子","language":"zh","domain":"文献术语","concept_id":null,"families":[],"definition_zh":null,"definition_en":null,"scope_note":null,"usage_note":null,"usage_overview":null,"translation_note":null,"usage_variants":[],"designations":[{"id":"W25e51c692a413020b55cca44","text":"二维插值算子","language":"zh","role":"headword"}],"complete_examples":[{"id":"Sd44521c18b2bb5c90a9a","source_id":"P131","page":1,"page_end":1,"language":"zh","text":"首先,基于轨道不平顺概率模型,采用轨道不平顺累计概率谱确定具有不同激振能量的随机不平顺序列;依据离散Parseval 定理,建立轨道不平顺时域序列和功率谱间的对应关系;将轨道不平顺概率模型与车辆-轨道耦合动力学模型相结合,从随机动力计算中提取车辆-轨道的动力极值及可靠度信息;随后利用车辆-轨道耦合动力模型及二维插值算子,根据谱线能量关系实现动力极值预测;此外,基于此系统激励输入与响应输出间的概率等效性,导出了动力极值的可靠度计算式。","citations":[{"source_id":"P131","page":1,"page_end":1}]}],"sources":{"P131":{"id":"P131","title":"车辆-轨道系统动力极值预测及可靠度计算","authors":"徐磊,朱雪燕,金浩然,刘鹏飞,闫斌,余志武","year":"2024","doi":"10.19713/j.cnki.43-1423/u.T20231395","journal_citation":"铁道科学与工程学报","label":"徐磊等（2024）","overview_slug":"2024-dynamic-extrema-prediction-and-reliability-assessment-of-vehicle-track-coupled-system"}},"relations":[],"related_terms":[],"collocations":[],"symbols":[],"units":[],"formulas":[],"external_references":[],"suggested_comparisons":[],"contexts":[{"text":"根据两类谱面积在预计算响应曲面上预测动力极值。","language":"zh","source_id":"P131","paper_slug":"2024-dynamic-extrema-prediction-and-reliability-assessment-of-vehicle-track-coupled-system","title":"车辆-轨道系统动力极值预测及可靠度计算","kind":"paper_usage"}],"word_links":[{"id":"Wf701b2ef2c16c927992b0357","name":"two-dimensional interpolation operator","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"文献参考译法","reason":null}],"expression_links":[{"id":"Wf701b2ef2c16c927992b0357","name":"two-dimensional interpolation operator","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"文献参考译法","reason":null}],"same_language_synonyms":[],"cross_language_equivalents":[{"id":"Wf701b2ef2c16c927992b0357","name":"two-dimensional interpolation operator","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"文献